<title>JAPAN: Misawa Ceramic - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Misawa Ceramic - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		  9.84		vs	    8.85</p>
<p> Operating	   69    million	  vs	   31    million</p>
<p> Current	     70    million	  vs	   53    million</p>
<p> Net		   19    million	  vs	    5    million</p>
<p> EPS		    1.19 yen	  vs	    0.33 yen</p>
<p> Shares	     16 million	  vs	  16 million</p>
<p> Interim div	    --		vs		--</p>
<p>NOTE - Misawa Ceramic Chemical Co Ltd is a specialist manufacturer of ceramic housing materials for Misawa Homes Co Ltd.</p>
